  {
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-19T14:51:00.000Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z",
    "id": "TN04telegramNotifyX",
    "name": "04_Telegram_Notify",
    "description": "Receives real \"nervous system\" events via factory_loop.js's notifyGoldenHunterAccepted()/notifyFactoryRecoveryEvent() (lib/n8n_notify.js), and forwards each to Telegram as a real Arabic message via a plain HTTP Request to Telegram's Bot API (not an n8n Telegram credential -- this instance's REST API/UI was not reachable this session to create one; TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN/OPENCLAW_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID are read from the n8n process's own environment via $env, never embedded in this file). Autonomous Digital Company v1 follow-up (2026-07-19): the \"Build Telegram Message\" node used to hardcode ONE message template regardless of the real event field sent to it -- every other event type (factory_stopped_unexpectedly, factory_recovered, recovery_completed, retry_queue_status) silently produced a garbled golden-hunter-shaped message with undefined fields. Now branches on $json.body.event with the correct Arabic template per event, plus two newly wired events: pending_review_needed (\"جاهز للمراجعة\") and sale_detected (\"بيع جديد\"). Imported via CLI while n8n was offline (ADR-072) -- same safe pattern as ADR-045. Message text is Arabic (ADR-073, 2026-07-18): the founder reads Arabic, not English.",
    "active": true,
    "isArchived": false,
    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "path": "golden-hunter-notify",
          "httpMethod": "POST",
          "options": {}
        },
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
        "typeVersion": 2.1,
        "position": [
          -560,
          0
        ],
        "id": "b1c2d3e4-0001-4a11-9e11-000000000001",
        "name": "Webhook",
        "webhookId": "b1c2d3e4-0001-4a11-9e11-000000000099"
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "assignments": {
            "assignments": [
              {
                "id": "b1c2d3e4-0002-4a11-9e11-000000000002",
                "name": "message",
                "value": "={{ $json.body.event === \"golden_opportunity_accepted\" ? (\"🏆 الصياد الذهبي قبل فرصة جديدة\\n\\nالمجال: \" + $json.body.niche + \"\\nالنقاط: \" + $json.body.opportunity_score + \"/100\" + ($json.body.price ? (\"\\nالسعر المقترح: $\" + $json.body.price) : \"\")) :\n    $json.body.event === \"factory_stopped_unexpectedly\" ? (\"🚨 عطل حرج — توقّف المصنع بشكل غير متوقع\\n\\nالسبب: \" + $json.body.reason) :\n    $json.body.event === \"factory_recovered\" ? (\"✅ تعافى المصنع وعاد للعمل\\n\\nالسبب: \" + $json.body.reason) :\n    $json.body.event === \"recovery_completed\" ? (\"✅ اكتملت عملية الاسترجاع\\n\\nالمرحلة: \" + ($json.body.stage || \"غير محددة\")) :\n    $json.body.event === \"retry_queue_status\" ? (\"🔁 حالة قائمة إعادة المحاولة\\n\\nعدد المهام المعلَّقة: \" + $json.body.pending_count) :\n    $json.body.event === \"pending_review_needed\" ? (\"📝 منتج جاهز للمراجعة\\n\\nيوجد \" + $json.body.count + \" مسودة بانتظار المراجعة البشرية\") :\n    $json.body.event === \"sale_detected\" ? (\"💰 بيع جديد!\\n\\nعدد المبيعات الجديدة: \" + $json.body.total_new_sales) :\n    (\"📩 إشعار من OpenClaw: \" + $json.body.event) }}",
                "type": "string"
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {}
        },
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
        "typeVersion": 3.4,
        "position": [
          -384,
          0
        ],
        "id": "b1c2d3e4-0003-4a11-9e11-000000000003",
        "name": "Build Telegram Message"
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "=https://api.telegram.org/bot{{ $env.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN }}/sendMessage?chat_id={{ $env.OPENCLAW_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID }}&text={{ encodeURIComponent($json.message) }}",
          "options": {}
        },
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.4,
        "position": [
          -192,
          0
        ],
        "id": "b1c2d3e4-0004-4a11-9e11-000000000004",
        "name": "Send Telegram Message"
      }
    ],
    "connections": {
      "Webhook": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "Build Telegram Message",
              "type": "main",
              "index": 0
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      "Build Telegram Message": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "Send Telegram Message",
              "type": "main",
              "index": 0
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
